### Health Check

GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### Register User

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "Sales User",
"email": "[sales@example.com](mailto:sales@example.com)",
"password": "password123"
}

###

### Login

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "[admin@example.com](mailto:admin@example.com)",
"password": "admin123"
}

###

### Get Products (Replace TOKEN)

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Create Product (ADMIN only)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
"sku": "P100",
"name": "Laptop",
"price": 50000,
"stockQty": 10
}

###

### Get Product By Id

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Update Product

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
"name": "Laptop Updated",
"price": 55000,
"stockQty": 15
}

###

### Delete Product

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Get Customers

GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Create Customer (ADMIN only)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
"code": "C001",
"name": "John Doe",
"phone": "9876543210",
"email": "[john@example.com](mailto:john@example.com)"
}

###

### Get Customer By Id

GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Update Customer

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
"name": "John Doe Updated",
"phone": "9999999999"
}

###

### Delete Customer

DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Get Sales Orders

GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Create Sales Order

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
"customerId": 1,
"items": [
{
"productId": 1,
"quantity": 2,
"rate": 50000
}
]
}

###

### Get Sales Order By Id

GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Confirm Sales Order (ADMIN only)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### Unauthorized Test

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

###

### Invalid Token Test

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token


### 1. Register SALES_USER

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "Sales User",
"email": "[sales@example.com](mailto:sales@example.com)",
"password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Login as ADMIN

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "[admin@example.com](mailto:admin@example.com)",
"password": "admin123"
}

###

### 3. Login as SALES_USER

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "[sales@example.com](mailto:sales@example.com)",
"password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Create Product (ADMIN Token Required)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

{
"sku": "AUTH-PROD-001",
"name": "Authentication Product",
"price": 100,
"stockQty": 10
}

###

### 5. Get Products (ADMIN or SALES_USER)

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### 6. Create Customer (ADMIN Token Required)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

{
"code": "AUTH-CUST-001",
"name": "Auth Customer",
"phone": "9876543210",
"email": "[auth@example.com](mailto:auth@example.com)"
}

###

### 7. Create Sales Order (ADMIN or SALES_USER)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

{
"customerId": 1,
"items": [
{
"productId": 1,
"quantity": 2,
"rate": 100
}
]
}

###

### 8. Confirm Sales Order (ADMIN Only)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### 9. Unauthorized Request

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

###

### 10. Invalid Token

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

###

### 11. SALES_USER tries to create Product (Should Return 403)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SALES_USER_TOKEN

{
"sku": "FORBIDDEN-001",
"name": "Forbidden Product",
"price": 100,
"stockQty": 5
}

###

### 12. SALES_USER tries to confirm Order (Should Return 403)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/sales-orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer SALES_USER_TOKEN
